{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s001", "text": "Rättighet: Barnets för- eller efternamn kan inte bytas utan barnets tillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.3309326171875, "generation_seconds": 16.25099858501926, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s002", "text": "Barnet kan inte anslutas till ett trossamfund utan barnets tillstånd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.30120849609375, "generation_seconds": 12.337755867047235, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s003", "text": "Barnets tillstånd behövs också för utträde ur ett trossamfund.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.25592041015625, "generation_seconds": 14.360592334996909, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s004", "text": "Om barnets föräldrar skiljer sig, har barnet rätt att träffa båda sina föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.280609130859375, "generation_seconds": 15.56176236900501, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s005", "text": "Barnets åsikt ska beaktas senast när barnet ät tolv år gammalt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.322998046875, "generation_seconds": 13.428907490102574, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s006", "text": "Om barnet inte vill träffa någon av föräldrarna har hen rätt att säga sin åsikt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.26312255859375, "generation_seconds": 15.901431150035933, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s007", "text": "Barnets åsikt ska beaktas också när man fattar beslut om hos vilken förälder barnet ska bo.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s007.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.315582275390625, "generation_seconds": 17.552093391073868, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s008", "text": "Om det finns problem i familjen kan barnet själv be om vård utom hemmet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013347778247Z/hb-c09-u0234-s008.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.2900390625, "generation_seconds": 12.64942823187448, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0234-s009", "text": "Vård utom hemmet betyder att barnet bor någon annanstans än hos sina föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013601295586Z/hb-c09-u0234-s009.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.3331298828125, "generation_seconds": 14.283348487922922, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0236-s001", "text": "Det är fråga om barnkapning när", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013601295586Z/hb-c09-u0236-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.1346938775510202, "peak": 0.2445068359375, "generation_seconds": 7.019034170079976, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0237-s001", "text": "ett barn under 16 år som är bosatt i Finland förs utomlands utan vårdnadshavarens tillstånd", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013601295586Z/hb-c09-u0237-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.249481201171875, "generation_seconds": 22.51917239301838, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0239-s001", "text": "ett barn som förts utomlands inte har lämnats tillbaka till Finland vid avtalad tidpunkt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013601295586Z/hb-c09-u0239-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.301239013671875, "generation_seconds": 19.2012732392177, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0240-s001", "text": "I Finland är barnkapning ett brott.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013601295586Z/hb-c09-u0240-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.322509765625, "generation_seconds": 10.121028974186629, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0240-s002", "text": "Ta kontakt med polisen på din hemort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-tolv/narration-resume-20261103T013601295586Z/hb-c09-u0240-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.459259033203125, "generation_seconds": 8.845638749888167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
